              "summary": "The failed-jobs backlog in the jobs database has grown to 1388, with 47 malformed rows. There are currently 0 jobs being processed. Pgbouncer in the prod namespace has exhausted its connection pool. Restarting pgbouncer cleared the pool and resumed processing. I recommend deleting old failed jobs to free up space and reviewing the backlog for patterns.",
